WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
As you know, we're all
losing it a little bit.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.460
Times are tough, so many things

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.360
are screwed up at the moment.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.860
Here in California we're
dealing with fires.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.693
Terrible fires.

00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:12.570
I mean it's much worse
in Northern California,

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.720
but still I gotta tell you the air quality

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.740
is pretty bad here in Los Angeles too.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.140
Now a lot of friends of mine
that live in other parts

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.910
of the country have been asking me

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.740
how bad is the air quality
in LA at the moment?

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:30.240
And I thought, why not show you?

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.900
Why don't I demonstrate
how bad the air is?

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.670
It's a lot, lot more convincing
than just telling you.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.160
So here's what I'm gonna do.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:42.160
I've got a clean bleached
white towel right here.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:45.820
I'm gonna hold it outside in the LA air

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.701
and shake it around for just

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.703
a second and show you.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:55.130
(door closing)

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.270
That's how bad it is.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:58.230
Wow that is really something.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.920
Yeah, that was quite a demonstration

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.230
of our air quality here in LA.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.123
Informative just not really very funny.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:08.310
Well that's okay.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.150
We can always just cut
to a video of old people

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.233
working out to generic heavy metal.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.684
Good idea, Andy.

00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:18.351
(upbeat music)

